Package: tsbiomass
Title: TS Biomass Model Transferability Package
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Bundles the TS-model transferability analysis pipeline, benchmark logic,
    admissibility screening, uncertainty benchmarking, sensitivity analyses,
    and figure-generation pipeline used for TS-to-biomass transfer analyses.
    The package is configuration-driven and can be run from YAML/JSON
    files or from the preserved command-line interface.
URL: https://brandynlucca.github.io/tsbiomass/, https://github.com/brandynlucca/tsbiomass
BugReports: https://github.com/brandynlucca/tsbiomass/issues
